{
  "en": {
    "Trunks": "Trunks",
    "And so he left, putting his fear aside.": "And so he left, putting his fear aside.",
    "KINGMOD_TRUNKS_SKIN_DBS": "DBS",
    "KINGMOD_TRUNKS_SKIN_DBZ": "DBZ",
    "Saiyan Blood": "Saiyan Blood",
    "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.",
    "Sword Strike": "Sword Strike",
    "Deal <color=#E5C962>320% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>": "Deal <color=#E5C962>320% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>",
    "Sword Strike Alternate": "Sword Strike Alternate",
    "Deal <color=#E5C962>320% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Free movement, but does not Auto-Move.</color>": "Deal <color=#E5C962>320% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Free movement, but does not Auto-Move.</color>",
    "Shining Sword Attack": "Shining Sword Attack",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nDash towards a target and rapidly unleash a barrage of sword strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>240% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>\nOnce released, unleash an additional energy blast, dealing <color=#E5C962>660% Damage</color>!": "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nDash towards a target and rapidly unleash a barrage of sword strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>240% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>\nOnce released, unleash an additional energy blast, dealing <color=#E5C962>660% Damage</color>!",
    "Ki Charge": "Ki Charge",
    "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second!": "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second!",
    "Flip": "Flip",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPerform a quick flip in a direction.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gain Invulnerability whilst skill is active</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPerform a quick flip in a direction.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gain Invulnerability whilst skill is active</color>",
    "Burning Attack": "Burning Attack",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nPerform a series of rapid arm movements, firing a flaming explosive ball of energy! \nExplodes on hit, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color>!\n": "Costs <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nPerform a series of rapid arm movements, firing a flaming explosive ball of energy! \nExplodes on hit, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color>!\n",
    "Swift Massacre": "Swift Massacre",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nVanish at light speed and swiftly strike nearby enemies in front dealing <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color>!\n<color=#03f4fc>Additional Damage is dealt when the same target is hit more than once.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Duration can be extended at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color><color=#03f4fc> per second!</color>\n<color=#999999>The number of strikes scales off attack speed.</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nVanish at light speed and swiftly strike nearby enemies in front dealing <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color>!\n<color=#03f4fc>Additional Damage is dealt when the same target is hit more than once.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Duration can be extended at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color><color=#03f4fc> per second!</color>\n<color=#999999>The number of strikes scales off attack speed.</color>",
    "Change The Future": "Change The Future",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nQuickly fire a large explosion! \nDamaging all enemies in front, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color>!\n": "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nQuickly fire a large explosion! \nDamaging all enemies in front, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color>!\n",
    "Heat Dome Attack": "Heat Dome Attack",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGenerate immense power to fire an energy wave upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!\nBurn nearby enemies while charging, dealing <color=#E5C962>300% Damage</color> per second!\nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color> and size per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGenerate immense power to fire an energy wave upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!\nBurn nearby enemies while charging, dealing <color=#E5C962>300% Damage</color> per second!\nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color> and size per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>",
    "Inexperienced Power Up": "Inexperienced Power Up",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nChannel your Saiyan strength, gaining <color=#E5C962>30% Damage</color> and <color=#00FF00>15% Health Regen</color> for 10 seconds!": "Costs <color=#03bcff>50 Ki</color>\nChannel your Saiyan strength, gaining <color=#E5C962>30% Damage</color> and <color=#00FF00>15% Health Regen</color> for 10 seconds!",
    "Masenko": "Masenko",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nUnleash the signature Masenko, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1850% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nUnleash the signature Masenko, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1850% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!",
    "Sword Of Hope": "Sword Of Hope",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nWith an unwavering spirit, summon the Sword of Hope\nGranting a bonus <color=#E5C962>80% Damage</color> and <color=#E5C962>60% Critical Strike Chance</color> while active.\n<color=#03f4fc>This skill requires </color><color=#097CFF>Light Charge </color><color=#03f4fc>to be full and consumes it over time</color>": "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nWith an unwavering spirit, summon the Sword of Hope\nGranting a bonus <color=#E5C962>80% Damage</color> and <color=#E5C962>60% Critical Strike Chance</color> while active.\n<color=#03f4fc>This skill requires </color><color=#097CFF>Light Charge </color><color=#03f4fc>to be full and consumes it over time</color>",
